      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 70: 🔴 The decoder mutates input packet metadata (`pkt-\u003epts -\u003d nb_samples`). Decoder code should treat `AVPacket` as input-only; mutating it can corrupt downstream timestamp handling for callers that reuse or inspect packet timing. Compute a local recovered start PTS and assign `frame-\u003epts` from that local value, leaving `pkt` unchanged.",
      "revId": "58af4ef51dd7f26ef9b1ba976871dc10ea008efe",
